    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>When the user wants to click on the Open MenuButton and click the All Items Option, the All Items option is not clickable and  the Open Menu drop down menu is not closed.</p>



<p>Steps to reproduce: </p>

<ul>
	<li>The user visits the link <a href="https://www.saucedemo.com/" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.saucedemo.com/</a></li>
	<li>The user inputs a valid username into the username" field, for example "standard_user"</li>
	<li>The user inputs a valid password into the password field, for example "secret_sauce"</li>
	<li>The user clicks on the "login" button</li>
	<li>The user clicks on the "open menu" button</li>
	<li>The user clicks on the "all items" button</li>
</ul>




<p>Expected result: The "all items" button is successfully clicked on, the Open Menu drop down menu is closed and the the page with all the items is visible</p>



<p>Actual result: the All Items option is not clickable and  the Open Menu drop down menu is not closed</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

